    owl:unionOf ( <https://w3id.org/ai4curation/gene_review/ParsimonyEnum#PARSIMONIOUS> <https://w3id.org/ai4curation/gene_review/ParsimonyEnum#ACCEPTABLE> <https://w3id.org/ai4curation/gene_review/ParsimonyEnum#REDUNDANT> <https://w3id.org/ai4curation/gene_review/ParsimonyEnum#OVERLY_COMPLEX> ) ;
